# Normalise line endings.
#
# This repo is edited from both WSL2 and Windows.  Without this, a clone or an
# editor on the Windows side rewrites every file to CRLF, producing a diff that
# touches every line of every file while changing nothing -- exactly what
# happened to a stray nested clone (7378 insertions, 7378 deletions, zero real
# content change).
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` stores everything as LF in the repository and checks it out
# as LF, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch these.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.bin   binary
*.elf   binary
*.hex   binary
